WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.990
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.140
...crazy about you!

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:50.750
I'm sorry, Okayasu...

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:55.500
I really think it wouldn't
work between us...

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:06.390
"'The Truth About Good-byes"'

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:13.350
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.120
Mm-hmm.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:21.100
Did you hear that, Okayasu? That's that.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:23.100
Please give up on Adachi.

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:24.370
Let's go.

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:46.990
Toji!

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:54.890
Okayasu!

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.410
You should have raised the girl better.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:04.750
There you go again, blaming me
for anything bad that happens...

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.440
Well, you're always-

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.750
Let us in, please!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.090
Go! Please!

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:14.420
Hey!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:17.290
What the... How rude!
No apology or anything!

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.120
Okayasu! Okayasu!

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.170
That little bastard...

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:33.740
Are you the one who called us?

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.100
We're Kashiwagi Sae's parents.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:54.800
Why won't it work with me?

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.460
You're not enough for me.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.130
I'm always anxious
when I'm with you, Okayasu.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:00.340
"'I can't wait to see you."'

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:04.410
I look forward to something and I wait
for you, then you dodge away from me.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.740
The amount of anticipation I've felt
is equaled by pain you've caused me.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:13.180
But Toji's not like that.
He really is very good to me.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.420
Being with him relaxes me.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:19.620
While I was with you, Okayasu,
I sold myself cheaply,

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.420
satisfied being your second best,

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:25.090
when in my heart,
I was never okay with it.

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:29.100
I need someone who's going
to treasure only me!

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:30.770
That's why it won't
work with you, Okayasu.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:35.100
I will treasure you! I won't get
your hopes up, and then betray you!

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.440
Momo-chan, I'll take good care of you!

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:39.110
You're such a liar!

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:41.110
You say that, when you're
still in love with Misao-chan!

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:45.110
N- no, that's not...
Misao-chan and I are...

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.600
"'Toji"'

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:48.450
Toji?

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.210
Hello? Adachi?!

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:55.120
Mm-hmm, I'm fine. Right now, we're on
the plaza of the boulevard by the sea...

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:56.120
After this...

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:58.430
Ah! Wait! The batteries!

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:01.160
"'Batteries are empty
Please recharge"'

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.730
Momo-chan...

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:07.070
I don't have any romantic feelings
for Misao-chan any more!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:10.940
Now, you're the one that I love,
Momo-chan. Believe me!

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:14.740
I just... I just can't believe that.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:17.080
It's true! Believe it!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:22.420
You're the one that I love, Momo-chan!
You're the only one!

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:25.420
No, it's no good. I can't believe it.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.760
Why not?! What can I do
to make you believe it?

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:33.460
Not possible... You see, Okayasu,
my feelings for you are like this...

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:36.160
"'Batteries are empty
Please recharge"'

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.600
I'm sorry...

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:51.810
I need someone who's going
to treasure only me.

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:54.340
Adachi!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.350
That's why...

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:05.790
Toji's the one.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:14.240
"'Survey of Preferred Colleges"'
Oh, man! I'm in trouble...

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:14.400
Oh, man! I'm in trouble...

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:18.740
At this rate, I'm going to have
a hard time getting into any college.

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:22.080
You'll be fine. You still
have more than a year to go.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.410
Even so...

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:25.410
Are you going to try to go
to the same college as me?

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:30.750
What?! Are you nuts?! Toji, I'll never be
able to make the kind of grades you do!

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:33.280
Don't say you can't do it until you try!

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:38.430
Some kids are already preparing
for their entrance exams...

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:42.430
From now on it won't be possible to have
a part-time job, or to have any fun.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:45.890
I tell you what... On the next
three-day weekend, want to go someplace?

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:50.100
--A petit vacation?!
--A petit vacation?!
--A petit vacation?!

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:51.770
--With Toji?!
--Just the two of you?!

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:56.110
Well, pretty soon it'll be time to
think about getting into college,

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:58.450
so we thought we'd go now,
while we have some time for it...

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:02.720
I get it! And you want us to
help you out with an alibi, right?

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:06.390
No, no! We're just going for the day,
so it should be all right!

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:10.060
But if there's another typhoon
or something and we can't get back...

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:15.060
True! You never know what's going
to happen when you're on holiday!

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:17.070
So, if I need it? Just in case?

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:19.400
Yeah, yeah. Just in case.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:21.070
So, when are you going?

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:22.070
This next holiday weekend.

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:23.400
Oh? And where to?

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.070
We still don't...

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.130
I want to go to Okinawa!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.080
A day trip is a little too strenuous,
so I'd rather stay over!

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.170
Sae!

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:38.210
I'm glad you're looking
so well. I'm relieved.

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:45.060
Now that I know I'm not pregnant,
everything seems fine.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.100
It's like a weight off of me.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:49.430
What about that jerk of a brother?

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:53.100
I'm done with that. I did my best.

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:58.440
I couldn't get Ryo to love me, but it was
the first time I really loved someone else.

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:02.210
I have no regrets about it.
Like, it's all burned out.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.050
You're being very forthright.

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:11.210
Well, up to now I've been too muddled up.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:19.730
She lost so much, and was hurt so much,

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:22.730
and yet she's not unhappy
about all that pain?

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.200
See you later!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:31.770
Strangely, l'm envious of Sae being able
to say it was all burned out of her...

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:40.350
What're you sitting here like a fool for?!
You're underfoot, so get outta the way!

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:43.420
Sae-chan!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:44.750
How're you feeling?

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:48.090
Not bad... When I'm home,
my folks are annoying.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:51.530
Oh, yeah. Sae-chan, you've had
a lot of stuff happen to you, too.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:56.860
"'Boo-Hoo-Hoo-Hoo"'

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:57.770
Yuck!

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:01.370
What?! God, you're annoying!
What are you all in a funk about?!

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:05.370
Leave me alone... I'm just
a useless old dead battery...

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:07.430
Huh? What?

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:14.380
A dead battery, huh?
Even Momo-chan can be pretty harsh!

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:18.050
And that's why you're
giving up on Momo-chan?

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:22.390
Can't be helped. She won't believe me...

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:26.730
Listen here, you! A battery can be
recharged and brought back to life!

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.730
Why are you just retreating?!

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:32.400
You never take a girl at her word!

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:36.070
If you don't go back
and try again, she won't listen!

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:38.070
Not a stubborn one like her!

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:39.740
For heaven's sakes!

00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:44.410
Thank you! I never thought you
would be cheering me up, Sae-chan.

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:45.780
God! You're annoying!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.090
There! All ready!

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:55.760
Momo? Your friend is here to pick you up!

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:58.690
Yoo-hoo! Momo-chan! You all ready?

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:04.770
You're not really planning
on going along, are you?!

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:10.770
No, no! I'm just helping with your alibi.
And I thought I'd give you a farewell gift.

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:12.330
Gift?

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:15.110
Momo-chan...

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:16.740
Are you happy now?

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:19.780
Yes, I'm happy.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:21.450
I wonder...

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.320
Maybe you're regretting kicking aside

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:25.450
Okayasu's somewhat
energetic appeal to you...

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:27.120
H- how do you know?!

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:32.460
You can tell me! I bet that it rocked you
when Okayasu proclaimed his love for you!

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.200
But you couldn't just toss Toji aside!

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:37.130
If you did, Momo-chan,
you'd look like a real witch,

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:39.470
especially since you owe Toji
quite a debt of gratitude.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:42.800
So, even if you wanted to go to Okayasu,
you really couldn't, now could you?

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:46.970
Sae! What are you
trying to say?! I love Toji!

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:49.640
I'm happy with Toji, so leave us alone!

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:56.150
Poor Okayasu! Going all the way to
Shiranami in the middle of a typhoon!

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:59.880
He exhausted himself on a wasted effort,
and look what it got him!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.430
What did you just say?

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.790
Momo-chan, you and Okayasu

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.100
were supposed to go
to the sea together, right?

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:13.630
Well, Okayasu ran after you
all the way to Shiranami, Momo-chan...

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.790
How do you know all this?

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:36.790
Because I was with him.
I helped him look for you, Momo-chan.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:39.060
The trains had stopped running
because of the typhoon,

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.460
and we couldn't reach your cell phone,

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:43.800
so Okayasu went by himself
by taxi to Shiranami.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.800
On the way, the road was
blocked by a landslide,

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:49.470
so Okayasu got out of the taxi and walked.

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:51.810
He knew he could have
given up and gone home,

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.480
but he thought that you were
all alone and crying, Momo-chan,

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.810
and he wanted to be by your side.

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:03.580
But Momo-chan,
you weren't alone, were you?

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:11.030
Okayasu says he saw you.
You and Toji at the station in Shiranami.

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.430
That can't be...

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:20.430
Okayasu was there then?

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:23.770
I don't know why you were
with Toji, Momo-chan,

00:12:23.770 --> 00:12:26.110
but it seems like it was
quite a blow to Okayasu.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:30.440
After all, you don't walk 20 kilos
through the mountains in a typhoon

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.780
if you don't really care.

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:36.780
Well, I'm not telling you to
get back together with Okayasu.

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:38.790
After all, you're the
one involved, Momo-chan.

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:42.720
But please be aware that Okayasu
really tried his best to be there.

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.790
That's my farewell gift.

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.020
Well, bye!

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:52.770
No... That's not true...

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:57.470
He acted like nothing happened,
even after l came back from Shiranami...

00:12:57.470 --> 00:13:00.670
Good morning!
Sorry l didn't go the other day!

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:05.780
So, you got back together
with Toji. That's good.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.940
He knew everything, and yet...

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:14.420
Okayasu didn't want me
to feel bad about it...

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:18.150
I'm all emotional... I'm sorry!

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:22.100
It's true! Believe it!

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:27.030
You're the one that I love, Momo-chan!
You're the only one!

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:34.370
Okayasu...

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:44.790
Oh, you look just beautiful, Misao-chan!

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.790
I'm just meeting him, okay?

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:51.990
Oh, don't say that! There's still time,
so shall we go have some tea?

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:55.990
God, this is uncomfortable...

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.620
Adachi-san?

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:09.410
I'm telling you! Momo-chan and Toji
are going on a little trip!

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.750
And when I looked at the weather forecast,

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:15.080
the timing is unbelievable,
but there's another typhoon coming!

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.880
They might not be able to get home tonight.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.090
Aren't you going to stop them?

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:24.760
Impossible...
It's too late to do anything...

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:26.290
And after I went to
the trouble to appeal to her

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:28.760
about your going
all the way to Shiranami...

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.100
--When?!
--Just a minute ago.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:33.770
Momo-chan was stunned to
learn that you were there.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:37.440
She may even rethink
this trip she's going on.

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:39.440
What did you tell her for?!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.780
But you told me to tell her!

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.680
Oh, no! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:53.790
I had no idea that Okayasu
followed me there.

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:59.460
How must Okayasu have felt...
when he saw me with Toji?

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.730
So that's what happened...

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:07.740
I wondered why Kairi wouldn't
tell you the reason he was late.

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:10.400
The reason he was late?

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:13.740
That day, Ryo-kun was attacked by a man.

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:19.080
Luckily he wasn't badly hurt,
but I was in such a state of shock...

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:21.910
...that Kairi escorted me to the hospital.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:26.850
That's why he was late meeting
you for your trip, Adachi-san.

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.760
Oh, my...

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:37.100
If he'd told me, I would have waited!

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:40.430
How am I going to know
if he doesn't tell me?

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:43.100
Perhaps he was worried that
if he told you he was with me,

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:46.770
that you'd be even
more worried, Adachi-san.

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:50.780
He hadn't had a chance to tell you yet.

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:52.300
Tell me what?

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:56.780
That day, Kairi bought a rose.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:59.750
When I told him that
in the language of flowers,

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:02.720
a red rose symbolizes
affection and true love, he...

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:05.730
When l give this to Momo-chan,
she'll know how l feel!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.700
That she can be confident,

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:10.360
because l love Momo-chan
better than anyone!

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:21.080
I- I've done a horrible thing...

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:25.750
What shall I do? I'm going
to meet Toji soon...

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:28.420
But I can't see him.
Not feeling like this...

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:31.420
Right now, you might be feeling
full of guilt about Kairi,

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:35.420
but the important thing is
really how you feel, Adachi-san.

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:38.090
We've only been talking about Kairi,

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:40.760
but Tojigamori-kun has been
very patiently and strongly

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.100
looking out for you, Adachi-san.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.560
That's why you're seeing him now, right?

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:52.440
Both Tojigamori-kun and Kairi
love you very much, Adachi-san.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:58.450
And I think that what they
both want is for you to be happy.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.710
You need to look deep into your heart.

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:03.720
Are you going to keep on
seeing Tojigamori-kun?

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:06.390
Or are you going to
respond to Kairi's feelings?

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:09.060
Either decision may cause you regret.

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:13.130
But whichever you choose,
I think you will still find happiness.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.190
It's all up to you, Adachi-san.

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:20.490
So, don't be afraid. Just follow your heart.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.270
Misao-chan...

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:28.410
Misao...

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:30.080
It's almost time to go.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:30.740
Oh, okay.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:35.750
I'm sorry! I've taken up a lot of your time!
Are you here for a wedding or something?

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:37.750
Well... actually...

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:40.750
It's a meeting for an arranged marriage.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:45.760
My parents set it all up without asking me,
so I said I sort of have to meet him.

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:48.430
I thought I'll just have
a good meal and go home!

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:52.100
What about Okayasu's brother?

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:56.100
I found I simply cannot go out
with a useless individual like that,

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:59.870
so I told him plainly that we were done.

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:03.340
I did adore him, though!

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:22.530
Huh? What's this you're
looking at, Okayasu-kun?

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:26.260
They're photos from a parenting website.

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:32.070
In one way, parenting is
like a really thrilling game.

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:34.910
If you screw up, you produce
a dreadful human being,

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:37.080
but you can't go back and reset...

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:41.750
But there's also the possibility
of producing a treasure...

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:44.410
Maybe I really did want
to raise a child....

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:55.100
It looks like Momo-chan isn't here yet...

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.100
When were they to meet?

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:59.430
10:00. Don't tell me
she's changed her mind!

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:04.370
Maybe I shook her up a little bit!
Hot dog! You might still have a chance!

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:06.810
Come on! You can act a little happier!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:18.390
Toji! I was supposed to meet Toji
more than half an hour ago!

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:20.390
I'm sorry! I have to run!

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.050
Fine. Take care!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:28.460
Oh, dear... This is just
like that other time...

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.670
What am l gonna do?!

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:36.070
By the time l get there,
l'll be more than an hour late!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:41.080
What a jerk l am! l know exactly
the pain of being left waiting!

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:43.170
l'm so sorry, Toji! l'm so sorry!

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:49.910
She's an hour late.
Maybe she really is backing out.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:04.770
Well, well. I thought Toji would
hang in there a little longer.

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:08.440
Maybe with all he's been through
with you, he's just about had enough.

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:12.770
I know! I'll tell Momo-chan
that Toji went home!

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:15.780
Give that back!

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:19.450
Enough, already! What good will
it do to stir things up anymore?

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:23.120
Come on! As if you're not thrilled
that Momo-chan didn't show up!

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:25.120
Quit acting so righteous!

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:26.790
Come on, give it back!

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:27.450
No!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:30.460
Give it back! Give it to me!

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:31.620
Momo-chan!

00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:13.160
Adachi...

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:20.440
Boy, are you sweating! Did you run here?

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:22.440
Uh... Uh-huh.

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:28.250
I thought so! Adachi, I thought you'd
coming running in all flustered! Want one?

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:32.120
I'm sorry!

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:33.790
It's okay.

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:37.220
I knew that you'd never just
cancel for no reason, Adachi.

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:46.470
You need to look deep into your heart.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:49.140
Either decision may cause you regret.

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:53.040
But whichever you choose, l think
you will still find happiness.

00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:56.300
lt's all up to you, Adachi-san.

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:05.780
Thank you.

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:11.880
Shall we go?

00:22:37.190 --> 00:22:43.200
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:52.870
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:55.880
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.880 --> 00:23:02.480
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:08.820
Where can we go

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:18.500
where we can all be

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:21.170
under the same sky?

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:29.510
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:36.180
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:42.520
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:49.860
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:57.400
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.140 --> 00:24:04.480
Okayasu... Was l just
running away from Okayasu?

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:06.480
Maybe l was afraid of losing him again...

00:24:06.480 --> 00:24:11.820
But l'm not going to run away any more!
This time l'll face him! So, please be safe!

00:24:11.820 --> 00:24:14.650
Next time, the final episode,
"'Last Hurricane!"'
